### venv ###
# Virtualenv
# http://iamzed.com/2009/05/07/a-primer-on-virtualenv/
#
# The upstream template ignores an *unprefixed* virtualenv's internals —
# [Bb]in, [Ii]nclude, [Ll]ib, [Ll]ib64, [Ll]ocal, [Ss]cripts. Those patterns are
# unanchored, so they match at any depth: `[Ss]cripts` silently swallowed this
# project's own `scripts/` directory (schema.sql, the seeds, export_openapi.py).
# The virtualenv here is `.venv/`, already ignored above, so the whole block was
# redundant. Do not paste it back.
pyvenv.cfg
pip-selfcheck.json


