# End of https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/venv,python
# Real environment files. `.env.staging` was MISSING from this list while
# `.env.staging.exemple` shipped telling you to copy it to .env.staging and
# fill in real values - so the one file the template asks you to create was
# the one file git would have committed. The four sibling annexes share the gap.
#
# `.env.test` and the three *.exemple files are deliberately NOT listed: they
# carry no secrets and are meant to be tracked.
.env.local
.env.staging
.env.production
